                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eee2c0bd-77cb-3822-8852-870f7c63e6f6",
                        "entry_id": "2ec8a0c9-f39a-33fc-b381-1e8fc8d7785d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "биол. резко выделяющаяся по внешнему виду группа фенотипов внутри вида или популяции"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "31138446-db82-4c38-bf32-fdbe71874cfb",
                                "sense_id": "eee2c0bd-77cb-3822-8852-870f7c63e6f6",
                                "text": "Морфа различных видов и родов связана с различиями химического состава организмов."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4758bea8-7366-3bc4-9b8a-2d08275b0530",
                        "entry_id": "2ec8a0c9-f39a-33fc-b381-1e8fc8d7785d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "лингв. предельная единица, выделяемая на субморфемном уровне исследования языка, которая в отличие от варианта морфемы не обладает свойством регулярной воспроизводимости согласно определённой морфологической модели"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "84ccdac0-788a-3070-957d-25dc98810835",
                        "entry_id": "2ec8a0c9-f39a-33fc-b381-1e8fc8d7785d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "лингв. то же, что алломорфа; вариант, разновидность, данная конкретная манифестация морфемы"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6c2dc856-0cb3-4110-baf3-da5737ec6b9e",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ec8a0c9-f39a-33fc-b381-1e8fc8d7785d",
                        "target_lang_word": "morph",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "morph",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "543693e5-0aca-3b19-ac7b-4267c2d78c3c",
                                        "entry_id": "5cb04793-f7c4-382e-a64f-10f531b35800",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A recurrent distinctive sound or sequence of sounds representing an indivisible morphological form; especially as representing a morpheme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52e8cf8c-3b16-4343-a644-b7b9853203d6",
                                                "sense_id": "543693e5-0aca-3b19-ac7b-4267c2d78c3c",
                                                "text": "Bq. ezpel ['box tree'] likely goes back to *ez-, a morph found in Basque tree names, and *-bel 'dark'."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d6e7069-388b-3e5c-bba9-fc639926b502",
                                        "entry_id": "5cb04793-f7c4-382e-a64f-10f531b35800",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An allomorph: one of a set of realizations that a morpheme can have in different contexts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "morph",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2a396816-fc00-38d9-8449-15b670accb78",
                                        "entry_id": "814cc477-e1f3-3ba6-94bc-19db119baa77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A variety of a species, distinguishable from other individuals of the species by morphology or behaviour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60f0dba0-c190-46ac-8385-7de6256fa25c",
                                                "sense_id": "2a396816-fc00-38d9-8449-15b670accb78",
                                                "text": "Briefly, the yellow morphic males can change their status from paired to satellite and from satellite to the paired one. However, they cannot cross into the status of the red morph."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "morph",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31889afd-85a6-3bfa-ba7a-7bfac5b62380",
                                        "entry_id": "22b9306c-8664-38ef-bc67-5d3959246926",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To change shape, from one form to another, through computer animation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive",
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a643354d-3bc9-3cad-af65-71e494e941cd",
                                        "entry_id": "22b9306c-8664-38ef-bc67-5d3959246926",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To shapeshift."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "749e2633-a4c9-4ac0-869b-c2a09f195811",
                                                "sense_id": "a643354d-3bc9-3cad-af65-71e494e941cd",
                                                "text": "Meta leapt forward. In midair his lower half morphed, and suddenly he was one-half humanoid, one-half coiled spring."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dda5fd61-8b3e-4f7b-b723-cccce77096a5",
                                                "sense_id": "a643354d-3bc9-3cad-af65-71e494e941cd",
                                                "text": "\"Would it reflect badly on women if I morphed my bust size up a bit for it? Sorta like wearing a padded bra?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23e06a3a-b0b6-331d-a951-4f1d9bbd6f07",
                                        "entry_id": "22b9306c-8664-38ef-bc67-5d3959246926",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To undergo dramatic change in a seamless and barely noticeable fashion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b5bb94d-dbd7-47b7-9547-e7c5144a2e5d",
                                                "sense_id": "23e06a3a-b0b6-331d-a951-4f1d9bbd6f07",
                                                "text": "By the time politicians in several cities backed down on Tuesday and announced that they would cut or consider reducing fares, the demonstrations had already morphed into a more sweeping social protest, with marchers waving banners carrying slogans like “The people have awakened.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f32e47cd-ad34-42a4-8cfe-f1aa48a60e70",
                                                "sense_id": "23e06a3a-b0b6-331d-a951-4f1d9bbd6f07",
                                                "text": "“Highbrow and lowbrow, alternative and mainstream, work and play, CEO and hipster are all morphing together today,” [Richard] Florida enthuses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "morph",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f859b201-f781-3b3b-973f-e2416c5ea873",
                                        "entry_id": "c7844279-9091-3976-8a42-748e3476dbf9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A computer-generated gradual change from one image to another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1731da8-aec5-4ed9-a95b-e6af41f7df37",
                                                "sense_id": "f859b201-f781-3b3b-973f-e2416c5ea873",
                                                "text": "But what is this metasubstance that blinks at us from the apex of the morph, and that in Terminator 2 is hyperbolized in the quicksilver substratum of the T-1000?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "morph",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5cf0885-c363-3cc0-bf9d-2106ba90d646",
                                        "entry_id": "12ae370c-1fe1-3385-85c6-d45af32feaeb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Morphine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f34a036a-9703-40ae-baaf-c659c8da8bbe",
                                                "sense_id": "b5cf0885-c363-3cc0-bf9d-2106ba90d646",
                                                "text": "They're bringing you some morph before long. […] The tube has its own needle, and the medic jabs it in like he has done it a million times, then marks Chickenfeed's forehead so the Rear will know he's already had morphine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "morph",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "011f51b7-9ca3-3490-8ce6-b727641feced",
                                        "entry_id": "b8416c94-a683-33b4-b654-629a36256eea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hermaphrodite, an intersex person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ec35371-bea7-490c-859c-dd11e494d10d",
                                                "sense_id": "011f51b7-9ca3-3490-8ce6-b727641feced",
                                                "text": "I am seeking to correspond with a TV [transvestite] or a natural morph. I want them to be passive (I'm totally non-violent) but open in feelings and ideas. I need no financial support, only moral support from a person with small sex parts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
